{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfN4gMtjyTxnP65RAqZ96","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```json\n[\n  {\n    \"unitKey\": \"20250323-machinery-q01\",\n    \"questionNumber\": 1,\n    \"part\": null,\n    \"status\": \"PASS\",\n    \"textIssues\": [],\n    \"choiceIssues\": [],\n    \"answerIssues\": [],\n    \"explanationIssues\": [],\n    \"figureIssues\": [],\n    \"sourceIssues\": [],\n    \"verifiedEvidence\": [\n      \"The question text matches the official original page (T2-K 004, page -1-, reviewedFromPage=[4]). This includes l[m], B[T], v[m/s], Φ[Wb], p, Z, a, D[m], n[min⁻¹], the peripheral speed v = πD·n/60 [m/s], and the order of blanks (ア)–(オ).\",\n      \"Choice (1) matches the original: 左手 / Bv/l / Z/a / 直列 / Z/(60pa)·Φn.\",\n      \"Choice (2) matches the original: 左手 / Blv / Za / 直列 / pZa/60·Φn.\",\n      \"Choice (3) matches the original: 右手 / Bv/l / Za / 並列 / pZa/60·Φn.\",\n      \"Choice (4) matches the original: 右手 / Blv / a/Z / 並列 / pZ/(60a)·Φn.\",\n      \"Choice (5) matches the original: 右手 / Blv / Z/a / 直列 / pZ/(60a)·Φn.\",\n      \"The official answer is 5, and the candidate's officialAnswer is also 5.\",\n      \"Recalculation: the total flux around the armature is pΦ = B_av·πD·l. So e_av = B_av·l·πD·n/60 = pΦn/60. Multiplying by the Z/a conductors in series in one parallel path gives E = pZΦn/(60a). This matches the explanation's derivation.\",\n      \"Unit check: Bv/l has units T·(m/s)/m = V/m², so it is not a voltage. The unit argument in the explanation for choice (1) is correct.\",\n      \"Every wrong choice's explanation correctly names which blanks are right and which are wrong. (1): ア, イ and オ are wrong. (2): ア, ウ and オ are wrong. (3): イ, ウ, エ and オ are wrong. (4): ウ and エ are wrong. None of these contradicts the correct combination.\",\n      \"The original has no figure. It contains only the question text and the combination table, so figureUrls=[] is app